{"id":"580258f190e8911a","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-hausdorff-gap.md","title":"Hausdorff Gap","display":"thm-hausdorff-gap — Hausdorff Gap","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hausdorff-gap","aliases":["58-thm-hausdorff-gap","Hausdorff Gap","Hausdorff Gap Theorem"],"display":"thm-hausdorff-gap — Hausdorff Gap","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hausdorff-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hausdorff-gap</span><span>Hausdorff Gap</span><span>Hausdorff Gap Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hausdorff-gap — Hausdorff Gap"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,X,Y,C\\in V\">\\(A,B,X,Y,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S\\)</span> (almost-inclusion predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\nX,Y\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(X\\setminus Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\nX,Y\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(X\\setminus Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}gap} \\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega_1,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,\\omega_1,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(A(\\alpha),A(\\beta))\n\\land\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(A(\\beta),B(\\beta))\n\\land\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(B(\\beta),B(\\alpha))\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(A(\\alpha),C)\n\\land\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(C,B(\\alpha))\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}gap} \\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega_1,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,\\omega_1,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(A(\\alpha),A(\\beta))\n\\land\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(A(\\beta),B(\\beta))\n\\land\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(B(\\beta),B(\\alpha))\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(A(\\alpha),C)\n\\land\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(C,B(\\alpha))\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hausdorff (1936): discovered gap construction.</li>\n<li>Luzin: stronger gap variant.</li>\n<li>Gap = hole in almost-inclusion ordering.</li>\n<li>Hausdorff gaps persist in standard Cohen extensions.</li>\n<li>Luzin gaps provide a stronger combinatorial form of the same phenomenon.</li>\n<li>Under additional hypotheses such as CH one obtains maximal gap constructions.</li>\n<li>Indestructibility: gap survives Cohen forcing.</li>\n<li>Applications: understanding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)/\\mathrm{fin}\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)/\\mathrm{fin}\\)</span> structure.</li>\n<li>Connection to: cardinal characteristics, Martin's Axiom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,X,Y,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubsetStar}_S(X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\nX,Y\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(X\\setminus Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}gap} \\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\m